<title>USA: Loewen files $500 mln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Loewen files $500 mln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loewen Group Internationl Inc filed Wednesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration to sell up to $500 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for working capital and general corporate purposes, including acquisitions.</p>
<p>Loewen, based in Burnaby, British Columbia, operates funeral homes and cemeteries in North America and funeral homes in Canada.</p>
